Package: lunduke-linux-kernel
Version: 7.2.6-lcos14
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: 28
Maintainer: LCOS <lcos@lunduke.com>
Homepage: https://lunduke.com
Depends: linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke (= 7.2.6-lcos14)
Recommends: linux-headers-7.2.6-lunduke (= 7.2.6-lcos14)
Description: Lunduke's Linux Kernel for LCOS
 Lunduke's Linux Kernel — LCOS kernel package (ABI lcos14).
 .
 Installs linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke. Headers are recommended for
 building out-of-tree modules.
 .
 lcos14 adds two modules on frozen lcos13: snd-intel8x0
 (CONFIG_SND_INTEL8X0=m, Intel 82801AA AC97 PCI 8086:2415, LCOS#94)
 and mt76x0e (CONFIG_MT76x0E=m, MediaTek MT7610E/MT7630E/MT7650E,
 PCI 14c3:7630, LCOS#95). The modem and USB variants stay off.
 Rust left off (No Forced Rust). No firmware blob is included.
 .
 LCOS 0.8 ISOs shipped 7.2.6-lcos12; that config stays frozen.
 lcos13 stays frozen. This package is the lcos14 revision of the same
 linux-image-7.2.6-lunduke name. On earlier LCOS releases that still
 ship a Distro kernel, installing this metapackage adds a GRUB entry
 alongside it.
